Job Description

The primary objective of this position is to manage the budget planning activities (PLN, LRP and LBE), actuals monitorization and related deliverables of the HQ for INTL, iCEX and IMAP organizations, as well as leading the INTL HQ (IMCO, IMAP and HQ) PTP activities, ensuring the right support to the organization, as well as the right internal controls in place, including the OEC controls. This position requires a senior collaborative individual, results oriented, with strong interpersonal skills, with good presentation and storytelling skills, able to perform with a high degree of autonomy and pro-activity in identifying and proposing solutions to the INTL HQ leaders. This position will be responsible also to manage the PTP team. The reporting line is to the IMCO Finance Director.
