- SPOC / SRM approval matrix: coordination of periodic review and updates;
- Support FD on iMax initiatives and other spend optimization initiatives (buy better / spend better) for IMCO, IMAP and INTL HQ;
- Create the necessary analytics to monitor spend, leveraging on PSM organization and on current spend analytics tools;
- Monitor INTL DPO initiative, working directly with PSM organization to identify drivers of performance, as well as identify opportunities for improvement;
- Coordinate PTP team an ensure the right level of support for IMCO, IMAP and INTL HQ organizations, with the right level of backup system in place;
- Ensure the right level of internal controls for PTP activities, including OEC controls;
- Drive for the PTP process improvements, working closely with the FD, as well as the relevant stakeholders, such as BSG, FSS and others;

